# The answer of RegExpMatchLiteral is made by the run time's own code for the form of the match (runtime/AOTRegExpOperations.cpp: createMatchValue(), valueOfFailedMatch()): no native function of the row is entered.
# So the record says what its form gives, and the row's word is not used. While the record took the row's word, with no test behind it, each of these lies was silent: no object null object.
# What Link makes of the row goes on to the places that it types, and there a door stands: the variable.
